{"t":"KTOS","made":"2026-11-18 01:51","name":"Kratos Defense & Security Solutions, Inc.","ko":"크라토스","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Aerospace & Defense","employees":4300,"hq":"San Diego, CA, United States","website":"https://www.kratosdefense.com","summary_en":"Kratos Defense & Security Solutions, Inc., a technology company, provides technology, hardware, products, system, and software for the defense, national security, and commercial markets in the United States, other North America, the Asia Pacific, the Middle East, Europe, and Internationally. The company operates through Kratos Government Solutions and Unmanned Systems segments. It offers virtualized ground systems for satellites and space vehicles, including software for command and control, telemetry, and tracking and control; jet powered unmanned aerial drone systems and hypersonic vehicles and rocket systems; propulsion systems for drones, missiles, loitering munitions, supersonic systems, spacecraft and launch systems, command, control, communication, computing, combat, and intelligence surveillance and reconnaissance; and microwave electronic products for missile, radar, missile defense, space, and satellite; and counter unmanned aircraft systems, directed energy, communication and other systems, and virtual and augmented reality training systems for the warfighter. In addition, It supplies turbine engines, engine components, accessories, and fuel management systems for PT6A, Twin-Pac, and JT15D aircraft engines. The company primarily serves national security-related agencies, the U.S. Department of Defense, intelligence and classified agencies, international government agencies, and domestic and international commercial customers. Kratos Defense & Security Solutions, Inc. was formerly known as Wireless Facilities, Inc. and changed its name to Kratos Defense & Security Solutions, Inc. in August 1999. Kratos Defense & Security Solutions, Inc. was incorporated in 1994 and is headquartered in San Diego, California.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"기술 회사인 Kratos Defense & Security Solutions, Inc.는 미국, 기타 북미, 아시아 태평양, 중동, 유럽 및 전 세계의 국방, 국가 안보 및 상업 시장에 기술, 하드웨어, 제품, 시스템 및 소프트웨어를 제공합니다. 이 회사는 Kratos 정부 솔루션 및 무인 시스템 부문을 통해 운영됩니다. 명령 및 제어, 원격 측정, 추적 및 제어용 소프트웨어를 포함하여 위성 및 우주선을 위한 가상화된 지상 시스템을 제공합니다. 제트 동력 무인 공중 드론 시스템, 극초음속 차량 및 로켓 시스템; 드론, 미사일, 체공 탄약, 초음속 시스템, 우주선 및 발사 시스템, 명령, 제어, 통신, 컴퓨팅, 전투, 정보 감시 및 정찰을 위한 추진 시스템; 미사일, 레이더, 미사일 방어, 우주 및 위성용 마이크로파 전자 제품; 무인 항공기 시스템, 지향성 에너지, 통신 및 기타 시스템, 전투원을 위한 가상 및 증강 현실 훈련 시스템. 이 회사는 주로 국가 안보 관련 기관, 미국 국방부, 정보 및 기밀 기관, 국제 정부 기관, 국내외 상업 고객에게 서비스를 제공합니다. Kratos Defense & Security Solutions, Inc.는 이전에 Wireless Facility, Inc.로 알려졌으며 1999년 8월에 Kratos Defense & Security Solutions, Inc.로 이름을 변경했습니다. Kratos Defense & Security Solutions, Inc.는 1994년에 설립되었으며 캘리포니아주 샌디에이고에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":31.1859,"mcap":5871478784.0,"pe":259.8825,"fpe":27.887629,"peg":null,"ps":3.565603,"pb":1.6962687,"ev_ebitda":53.42,"div":0.0,"beta":1.165,"hi52":134.0,"lo52":30.79},"fin":{"rev":1646700032.0,"rev_g":0.357,"eps_g":null,"gross":0.23021999,"op":0.00789,"net":0.013359999,"roe":0.0081,"fcf":-111575000.0,"cash":1404300032.0,"debt":246000000.0,"de":7.128,"eps":0.12,"feps":1.11827},"own":{"short":0.0653,"inst":0.83185,"insider":0.01283},"analyst":{"n":25,"mean":74.68,"median":72.0,"high":120.0,"low":46.0,"rec":"strong_buy","recMean":1.32,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":6,"buy":18,"hold":1,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":6,"buy":18,"hold":1,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":4,"buy":15,"hold":2,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":5,"buy":14,"hold":2,"sell":0,"strongSell":0}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-11-10","Firm":"Barclays","ToGrade":"Overweight","FromGrade":"Overweight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":80.0,"priorPriceTarget":90.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-11-09","Firm":"UBS","ToGrade":"Neutral","FromGrade":"Neutral"